            <ArticleTitle>[Prognostic and diagnostic criteria in the development of bronchial asthma in children of young school age].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>60-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The analyzes of anthropometric parameters, somatotype and dermatoglyphics of children aged 7-12 years with bronchial asthma have been studied. Obtained results have shown that somatotype and dermatoglyphics are specific genetic and phenotype markers of susceptibility to the development of bronchial asthma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
